BEGIN_PGML
To convert a temperature in degrees Celsius to degrees Kelvin, there is a formula [`F = \frac95C + 32\text{.}`]

What Fahrenheit temperature is [`[$C]℃\text{?}`]

[@KeyboardInstructions('Use [|degF|]* for degrees Fahrenheit.')@]**

[_]{$F}{10}


END_PGML

